    body:"FRONT LAW \u2014 LIVING TISSUE, NOT INSTALLED VOLUME. NO BREAST SELECTION MAY BEHAVE LIKE AN IMPLANT DISGUISED BY BIOLOGICAL LANGUAGE. The clinic note is the test: IF A TIT KNOCKS AGAINST A DESK RATHER THAN YIELDING TO IT, THE CLINIC HAS PRODUCED EITHER AN IMPLANT OR A DISCIPLINARY PROBLEM.\n\nAND THAT FRONT LAW IS WHY DENSE IS NOT A TIT HANDFEEL. Pillar Three permits DENSE on ass because the cheek carries real gluteal muscle, fascia and connective support beneath its softness \u2014 a hand meets surface yield and then genuine muscular resistance INSIDE THE ASS ITSELF. Breast tissue has no equivalent internal load-bearing muscle body. Pectoral muscle supports tits FROM BENEATH AND BEHIND and does not make the tissue Dense. THE TWO RULINGS ARE COMPLEMENTARY: SUPPORT BENEATH TITS IS NOT TIT HANDFEEL; MUSCULAR SUBSTANCE INSIDE A CHEEK MAY BE ASS HANDFEEL.\n\nSUPPORT IS NOT HANDFEEL. SUPPORT is chest wall, root, tissue and clothing managing weight. HANDFEEL is how tissue yields and returns. Two jurisdictions, one region.\n\nCLEAVAGE IS AN EVENT, NOT ANATOMY. It is not independently selected. THE BRA CREATES THE CLEAVAGE. THE TITS CREATE THE NEED FOR THE BRA. Silken Embrace formally requested the Clinic stop calling it an event, on the grounds that events require venues, staffing and occasionally ticket sales. THE RULING STANDS.\n\nSHOULDER LINE \u2014 NARROW-SOFT, CLASSIC SLOPE, WIDE-SOFT SWEEP. Wide-Soft Sweep DOES NOT MEAN SQUARED; the Immutable Core forbids squared shoulders and this field does not smuggle them back.\n\nMIDRIFF EXPRESSION \u2014 SMOOTH, POOCHED, TONED, ABS. ABS IS A SECRET MENU SELECTION AND IT IS BRYN\u2019S SIGNATURE. THE UNLOCK PHRASE IS: GIVE HER THE GRATER. RULED BY VIRAENA \u2014 GO BY THE DOCUMENT, THOSE ARE THE PHRASES. So the speaker is A WIFE AT THE DESK ASKING FOR HER WOMAN, not the woman asking for herself. GIVE ME THE GRATER was the Archive hearing it in conversation and Torie claimed in scene that she said it herself; NEITHER IS THE PHRASE. The gate is knowledge of the exact words, so the wording is the mechanism and the mechanism is now settled. See c-doc-phrases.\n\nTITS \u2014 FOUR FIELDS, NONE OF WHICH SILENTLY SELECTS ANOTHER.\nSHAPE: TEARDROP or BELL.\nCUP: familiar notation, VERIFIED AGAINST UNDERBUST AND BUST rather than asserted.\nHANDFEEL: SUPPLE, PLIANT, PLUSH. NO DENSE.\nLIVELINESS: QUIET, BOUNCY, SWAYING, DEEP-SETTLING.\n\nJURISDICTION NOTE ON SETTLEMENT. DEEP-SETTLING is LOCAL TIT PHYSICS and is available on any Build. ETHEREAL\u2019S AFTERTRACE SETTLEMENT is WHOLE-BODY SEQUENCING out of Distributed Resolution. SHARING THE WORD SETTLEMENT DOES NOT SHARE JURISDICTION. Confirmed by an unscheduled live demonstration beneath a blanket fort, after which the reviewing professor withdrew her objection, the foxwife withdrew what remained of her sweater, and Jade\u2019s minutes record applause.\n\nNIPPLE LENGTH \u2014 NUB, NATURAL, PERKY. AREOLA SCALE \u2014 SMALL, NATURAL. THERE IS NO BROAD SELECTION AND THERE IS NO PEPPERONI CONTINGENCY. Cassandra\u2019s napkin denial has not survived peer review.\n\nFULL CHEST INTEGRATION is ONE COMPLETE STATEMENT. It is never another selection engine and it never installs permanent cleavage.\n\nPROFILE RECORD: Shoulders \u00b7 Midriff \u00b7 Tits (Shape \u00b7 Cup \u00b7 Handfeel \u00b7 Liveliness) \u00b7 Nipples and Areolae \u00b7 Full Chest Integration \u00b7 Exact Refinement.\n\nPILLAR BOUNDARY: THE UPPER BODY IS NOT A SECOND BUILD. Silken Embrace governs the garment; Pillar Two governs the living anatomy inside it.",
