    body:"THE SECRET MENU IS NOT A REWARD TIER, A LOYALTY SCHEME, OR A THING A CLINICIAN CAN OFFER. IT IS A SET OF OPTIONS ABSENT FROM THE PRINTED CONSENT MENU UNTIL SOMEBODY SAYS THE WORDS. The form carries two checkboxes under each gated field \u2014 SECRET MENU PHRASE GIVEN, SECRET MENU SELECTION OPENED \u2014 and Final Authorisation attests that EVERY OPENED OPTION WAS INDEPENDENTLY UNLOCKED.\n\nTHE FOUR ANATOMICAL PHRASES, EXACT AS THE DOCUMENT RECORDS THEM.\nOBSCENE CHEEK PLUMP \u2014 SHOW ME THE BIGGER ASS BUTTON. Spoken by BELLA. Marianne tried MAXIMUM SUPPORTED WHOLE-CHEEK REALISATION and was overruled by every woman in the waiting room.\nABS MIDRIFF \u2014 GIVE HER THE GRATER. Bryn\u2019s signature selection, and the pronoun puts A WIFE AT THE DESK ASKING FOR HER WOMAN.\nSUBSTANTIAL BALLS \u2014 MAKE EM NICE AND FAT. Spoken by ORIANNA. WIFE HANDLES was rejected as the formal name for Plump because balls do not become communal property merely because somebody can fit both into one enthusiastic palm. THE PROPOSING WIFE HAS APPEALED.\nPUBIC HAIR \u2014 GONNA NEED THE CARPET TO MATCH THE DRAPES. Singular carpet. It concerns COLOUR PALETTE, NOT LENGTH, a clarification added after a nurse correctly identified a literal interpretation as MEDICALLY HARMLESS AND DOMESTICALLY CATASTROPHIC.\n\nAND THE FIFTH IS NOT AN ANATOMY UNLOCK AT ALL, WHICH THE ARCHIVE HAD WRONG. SWIGGITY SWOOTY, I AM CUMING IN THAT BOOTY opens TEST DRIVE, and TEST DRIVE IS A POST-AFFIRMATION SERVICE. It cannot be spoken during anatomical selection, because some services exist only after affirmation BECAUSE PRESENTING THEM EARLIER WOULD DISTORT THE DECISION TO AFFIRM. The woman must be FULLY AFFIRMED, MEDICALLY STABLE, CAPABLE OF FRESH CONSENT, AND MUST INDEPENDENTLY ASK IN THE RECOGNISED LANGUAGE. THE PHRASE IS PRESERVED EXACTLY AS FIRST SPOKEN, INCLUDING THE SPELLING OF CUMING. Marianne objected. Cassandra replied that ORTHOGRAPHIC DIGNITY HAD ALREADY LEFT THE ROOM AT SWIGGITY SWOOTY. NO AMENDMENT CARRIED.\n\nOPENING A SECRET MENU REVEALS AN OPTION. IT DOES NOT SECURE ANOTHER PERSON\u2019S PARTICIPATION. That line is written about Test Drive and governs all five.\n\nTHE ARCHIVE\u2019S STANDING RULE, UNCHANGED AND RESTATED HERE BECAUSE THIS IS THE RECORD WHERE IT MATTERS MOST: A PHRASE IS RECORDED SO THE SYSTEM CAN RECOGNISE IT, AND IS NEVER SURFACED TO A WOMAN WHO HAS NOT SAID ONE FIRST. The doctrine binds the Clinic and the Archive-acting-as-Clinic. It does not bind a household, where Bella has been saying hers out loud for eleven years.",
