    body:"BELL COMPLAINS TWICE A DAY, OUT LOUD, that her wife will not theatrically fuck her. Elspeth's code is DEVOTION, and devotion does not include theatrical dickings. What it includes is the same sequence, in the same order, every time.\n\nBEND HER OVER THE GRIMOIRE · PEEL THE PANTIES · APPLY LUBE · DICK · FUCK HER TENDERLY · CREAMPIE · PULL OUT · REAPPLY THE PANTIES WITH IT STILL INSIDE HER · GIVE MUFFIN · CUDDLE HER WHILE SHE EATS IT.\n\nBELL LEADS SEANCES FOR A LIVING AND HAS NOT RECOGNISED ONE ON HER OWN BODY. She has been screaming for a performance for years and has been having a SACRAMENT run on her the entire time.\n\nTHE SAME LOGIC IS POURED INTO THE FLOOR PLAN. The only entrance to Banshee Haven is the Left Titty — Elspeth's kitchen — and nobody reaches the seance or the stairs down without being fed first. You eat before you grieve, or the grief takes something out of you that you did not have to spare.\n\nRESONANCE COMES BEFORE CATHARSIS, and the house is built to enforce it.",
